{
  "slug": "claude-tamagotchi",
  "name": "Claude Tamagotchi",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A persistent Tamagotchi creature that lives in your Claude Code status line — evolves through emoji stages, has session-level moods, and can die from neglect, leaving an egg with inherited XP for the next generation",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 command** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Commands** (1): `tamagotchi` (View and manage your Tamagotchi creature — stats, rename, theme, setup, history)\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `Stop`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-tamagotchi@claude-community` from `ncrohn/claude-tamagotchi`.",
